{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "65f73b92-a0e0-51ff-8fb4-57cb38dff2a4", "source_ordinal": 2693, "reading_ordinal": 1360, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "自以为是", "published_at": "2022-07-05T16:34:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/27769516/answer/2559845187"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“自以为是”根本就不是问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "那些批评你自以为是的人自己也是根据自己所以为的“是”在确定你“不是”，以至于这种批评本身就是建立在自以为是的基础之上的。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "诚然，任何错误被犯下，都先经过了“自以为是”的过程，看似有绝对的关联。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但所有错误被犯下，也都经过了吃饭的过程，经过了呼吸的过程，何以这两者就和错误的结果毫无关系？", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 158}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "更进一步的，放弃了自己的判断，接受了张三的结论决定往左拐，从接受结论的这一瞬间开始，这个结论就变成了你所自以为的新的“是”。", "char_start": 159, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这时候李四跳出来劝你往右拐。你不答应，坚持要往左拐，李四还是会说你“自以为是”。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你能怎么改？谁来给你意见，为了不落这个罪名就全听对方的？", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "凭什么自以为是的是你，不是对方？", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "问题根本就不在于你是不是自以为是——这个如前所述，是根本无可避免的，没得“解决”可言。", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "既然自以为是本身不是问题，自然也就不存在“太自以为是”这个问题了。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "既然自以为是不是问题，那么问题在哪？", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "问题是你要如何避免别人做出这种评价。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "总是招致这种评价，乃至形成了这样一种“名声”，导致别人不愿意再给你任何建议和意见，这才是问题。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "秘诀在哪里呢？", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "举个例子，", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你高考只考了520分，觉得很痛苦，", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "于是你跑来问——“我高考考了520，我该不该复读？”", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "建议你复读的有100个，建议你不复读的有100个，无论你不听哪边，你都会得到100个自以为是的评价。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 588}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为你这个问题有毒。", "char_start": 589, "char_end": 599}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "“我该怎么办”，是一个问父母、问老师、问上司、问上帝的问题。", "char_start": 600, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你只要问了人，就等于已经公开声明你所询问的对象等同父母、老师、上司、上帝，等于已经宣布你将对方的判断权置于你自己之上，并将用完全（或至少部分的）服从对方作为最基本的回应。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你既然这样求了，对方拿给你的答案就不容你完全罔顾。只要你完全罔顾，你就已在事实上背信弃义，陷人于不义。", "char_start": 717, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不听他人的意见是无错的，但是不听你自己奉为师长的人的意见，就构成自以为是。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 806}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "解决方案是什么？", "char_start": 807, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "同样的问题，你改问“你们觉得低于多少分就不适合复读了/高于多少分适合复读”，则无论答案是什么，也不论你自己随后如何选择，自以为是的评价自然不会发生。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你问“我该往左转还是往右转”，无论答案是什么，无论你怎么选，总有一半人要判你自以为是。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 934}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你问“往左有哪些利弊/往右有哪些得失”，无论答案是什么，无论你后来怎么选，都没人能说你自以为是。", "char_start": 935, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你问“在这个情况下我该怎么办”，和“在这个情况下，有哪些可行的方案”，区别相同。", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1024}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "养成习惯，自己的事情，不要问人“应该怎么办”。", "char_start": 1025, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "只问情报，不问决定。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1059}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "只有别人的事情，才问人“你觉得应该怎么办”。", "char_start": 1060, "char_end": 1082}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "什么叫别人的事情？例如你是一个士兵，作战指挥是你的指挥官的事，所以你要问ta怎么办。", "char_start": 1083, "char_end": 1125}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你是一个雇工，干的是老板的事情，所以你要问ta怎么办。", "char_start": 1126, "char_end": 1153}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你是一个子女，决定行为举止是你父母的事情，所以你要问ta们怎么办。", "char_start": 1154, "char_end": 1187}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "权柄在别人手里，别人对结果负责，那么这时候就要问对方要怎么办。", "char_start": 1188, "char_end": 1219}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "除此之外，你自己负责的事，你自己决定。", "char_start": 1220, "char_end": 1239}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "你的事，不要问人“我应该怎么办”。", "char_start": 1240, "char_end": 1257}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "只要你问，你一定会得到“自以为是”的大红叉。", "char_start": 1258, "char_end": 1280}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "而你着实是活该。", "char_start": 1281, "char_end": 1289}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "反过来，作为一个回答问题的一方，不要回答“我该怎么办”这种问题。", "char_start": 1291, "char_end": 1323}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "如果你答了，你先记好——问问题的人并没意识到自己要为自己的言行负何种责任。", "char_start": 1324, "char_end": 1361}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "不要因为这个“拜师合约”被证明事实无效而去给这“逆徒”一个“自以为是”的判决。", "char_start": 1362, "char_end": 1401}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "ta本来就是乱拜山头，是你一开始不该受这一拜。", "char_start": 1402, "char_end": 1425}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我觉得自己太自以为是，怎样消除这种自以为是感觉？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044"], "summary": "围绕“自以为是”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““自以为是”根本就不是问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“自以为是”根本就不是问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e82d4166-a90e-533f-afba-be82df365d92", "source_ordinal": 2692, "reading_ordinal": 1361, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不害怕", "published_at": "2022-07-05T19:20:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/518437465/answer/2560107822"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这么说吧，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果你老板看上去一副心情紧绷不好惹的样子——也就是通常意义上所谓的“威严”、“气场”，", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你对ta最正确的对待根本就不该是“害怕”，而应该是同情和怜悯。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为这意味着ta压力很大，没有容错的雅量，也没有额外的能量来举重若轻、谈笑风生了。所以ta才会不自觉的“威压外露”，导致身边气压很低，所有人都紧张和焦虑。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "出于怜悯而努力帮助和出于恐惧而努力表现，方向是完全不一样的。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "前者所求的是有效缓解对方的痛苦，后者所求的是不发生可以被追究的责任。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 225}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "怜悯的人说“要不这样，我自己先写一份问题总结，您回头帮我看看有哪些补充。您先休息一下，不然您太累了”，说“妈妈别生气了，喝口水缓一缓，我会认真听的”。", "char_start": 226, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "恐惧的人说“这不能怪我”，“我不是有意的”，“都是xxx误导了我”，“我以为yyy是zzz的意思”。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "事实上，几乎所有对你大喊大叫的人——无论是父母、上司、配偶、子女，还是窗口的客户——都不是在寻求你的恐惧，而是在寻求你的怜悯。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 416}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta们只是会引起你的恐惧，但ta们寻求的不是你的恐惧。", "char_start": 417, "char_end": 444}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而ta们之所以在你报以恐惧之后又再升级“攻击”行为，其实不是在惩罚你的不够恐惧，而是在怨恨你的不够怜悯。", "char_start": 445, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果你搞错方向，报之以更大的恐惧，以为ta这下应该满足了。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 527}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你得到的会是ta们被更深刻的失望激活的更大的愤怒。", "char_start": 528, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "怜悯者上天堂，", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "恐惧者下地狱。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "参得透，何止不挨骂，老板公司都送给你。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 591}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么上位者会自带一种威严和气势和气场，要怎么样才能不害怕这种人？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“不害怕”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这么说吧，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这么说吧，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6288b127-9b76-55a0-9ddf-ff8f789b3850", "source_ordinal": 2691, "reading_ordinal": 1362, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "华容道", "published_at": "2022-07-06T15:47:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/56389460/answer/2561413066"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有个游戏叫《华容道》，不知道你们玩过没有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就是这玩意：", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "建议你们玩一玩。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "曹操就是你的恶习。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你吃了当头一棒，很想把曹操挪到大门口，一脚把他踢进垃圾桶。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但你挪了几下，纹丝不动。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因为关张赵马黄你没动啊。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "为什么关张赵马黄你挪不动？", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为四个卒你没动啊。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 129}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你就没有把关张赵马黄和四个卒看作问题的一部分，你只是单恨曹操。", "char_start": 130, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "天天蹲在门口跳着脚骂曹操。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 175}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "曹操也很烦，要能走，哪个龟儿的不走。", "char_start": 176, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "走不了好吗。", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "别说好了伤疤，忘了疼，就是伤疤没好，正在疼，也一样。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "曹操挪不走，你总会适应的。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "就像曹操最后适应了一样。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 255}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "疼就先挪卒。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 263}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2022-07/06/a4836433a33a6c466a01ee9133152afd.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么样能改掉好了伤疤忘了疼的毛病？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“华容道”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有个游戏叫《华容道》，不知道你们玩过没有。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有个游戏叫《华容道》，不知道你们玩过没有。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "013fbc42-4fbc-5347-8e02-127c9fae7cd4", "source_ordinal": 2690, "reading_ordinal": 1363, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "奴婢", "published_at": "2022-07-06T22:24:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/488407529/answer/2562009738"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "就因为打了一份工，这就认上“主子”了？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就因为对方有点钱和权，这就是“主子”了？", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "自认“丫鬟”也就罢了，还要幻想我跟你一样？", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "莫非你以为“自甘为奴”就可以讨这些“主人”“垂怜”么？以为将敢于大胆“冒犯”的人也替你的“主人”“奴化”可以获得ta们的“嘉许”？", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "反驳当然是可以反驳，但是我和你的“主人”们平辈论交，我看不出有反驳的必要。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 166}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你一个奴婢，ta们要知道了你在我面前说这种话，还打着ta们的名义，恐怕对你不大好。", "char_start": 167, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "看你可怜，这次就算了。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不要随便假设陌生人跟你差不多。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不要再有下次。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 244}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何反驳“你一个丫鬟不可怜你自己，去可怜你锦衣玉食的主子”?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“奴婢”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“就因为打了一份工，这就认上“主子”了？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "就因为打了一份工，这就认上“主子”了？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "6d761db2-aa20-5949-a97d-92fed232684a", "source_ordinal": 2689, "reading_ordinal": 1364, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "买东西", "published_at": "2022-07-08T09:39:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/22609816/answer/2564091570"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "1）这个东西能产生净收益吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "2）这东西放哪？", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "3）这东西家里人会反对吗？", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "4）这东西有可租、可借的吗？", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "5）这东西可以传代吗？可以作为遗物给人纪念或者凭吊吗？", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "6）这东西的耗材一直有得卖吗？", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "7）这东西有二手的卖吗？不用了，有人回收或者接手吗？", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 123}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "8）这东西可以改装吗？它的零件有可利用的空间吗？", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "9）这东西会造成碰撞、吞食、噪音、毒害等危险吗？", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "10）这东西会导致上瘾吗？", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 187}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "11）这东西可能升值吗？", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 200}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "12）这东西如果废弃，需要特殊的回收成本吗？", "char_start": 201, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "13）这东西有可靠的长期维护保养服务吗？", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "14）这东西会泄露隐私吗？", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "15）这东西方便搬家吗？", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "16）这东西合法吗？", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "17）这东西有道德风险吗？", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "18）这东西可以不要吗？", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 309}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：买东西都有什么好的原则要遵守？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“买东西”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“1）这个东西能产生净收益吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "1）这个东西能产生净收益吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "271d8f7f-c694-5db0-91c4-4af81d5ef096", "source_ordinal": 2688, "reading_ordinal": 1365, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "嬉笑的对价", "published_at": "2022-07-08T22:42:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/542183686/answer/2565337369"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "现代文明的一个主要的副作用就是推迟了人类的心理发育。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "目睹和经历死亡、灾难、失败、意外是接种到足够的“事实疫苗”、获得完整的心理免疫力和完全发育的首要途径。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但这些东西却由现代文明极大的避免了。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "三四十岁仍未经历过上述任何一种体验成了一个普遍的常态，于是人的心理发育在很大程度上残留着幼儿心态。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这其中，不严肃、嬉笑化是最首要的表现。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 167}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实要说这些人有多大的出于伤害目的的恶意，是谈不上的，ta们只是觉得好玩比较重要、而后果没什么要紧而已。", "char_start": 168, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这和小孩子扯掉昆虫的翅膀、踩死爬虫、用聚光镜烧鼻涕虫类似。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta们并不是想要去伤害这些生物，ta们只是追逐自己的快乐而已。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这也是为什么ta们往往又深陷缺少影响力和社会地位的苦闷和愤怒之中。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为要对这类行为免责、免咎，就必须要给予“小孩子不懂事”的定性。而给了这个定性，免了责任，同时也就葬送了作为成人的身份和地位。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "甘蔗没有两头甜，此世间常态也。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 396}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为何安倍晋三遇刺，网友如此开心？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“嬉笑的对价”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“现代文明的一个主要的副作用就是推迟了人类的心理发育。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "现代文明的一个主要的副作用就是推迟了人类的心理发育。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b75adaa9-456a-517a-a9b4-fd1fcd8849a0", "source_ordinal": 2687, "reading_ordinal": 1366, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "权力的游戏", "published_at": "2022-07-09T13:05:59+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/60350841/answer/2565992747"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "第一是大量阅读目标时期的文学和历史作品，大量浏览同一时代的实物展览、建筑古迹。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "人的大脑功能和人工智能很像，你用什么数据集去训练它，它输出来的产品自然带着什么味道。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "看多了金庸写出来就像金庸，看多了古龙写出来就像古龙。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第二是要对社会、文化、伦理这些人类行为的底层驱动机制有了解。就像纷繁复杂的物理世界其实只是四种作用力和一个复杂的起点的交互结果。任何故事也是处在不同初态的人物在你所设定的行为驱动机制下的交互结果。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 208}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人物如山坡上的小球，时代背景如高低起伏的山坡，你对世界规则的设定如重力。", "char_start": 209, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "都放置好了，按下播放键，然后小球们自己滚落下去即可。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 272}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "该有什么情节，就是什么情节，不要故意设计情节。", "char_start": 273, "char_end": 296}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不要“围绕高潮情节反过来设计人物”，那样写出来最多只有短篇，而且会导致人物本身“道具化”。", "char_start": 297, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "那么难道完全不管理情节走向吗？", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实在一开始你就已经通过初始条件的设定决定了情节走向。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 386}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "就像如果你一开始就设定为“捏住意大利面条的两端逐渐弯曲”，你就已经自然的设定了最后的“啪地一声断成三截”的结局。", "char_start": 387, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "到底什么时候断、断在哪里，你自己不要规定它，你只管这面是不是意大利面、这手有没有在加力，不要担心它不会断。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "中间放一个人，左边非要ta死，右边非要ta活，自然而然就会有故事有终结，不必刻意额外计划，你只管把你最大的才智分别借给各方去尽情施展——但要记住有些念头有些人想不出、有些主意某些人会不同意。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "然后每月初一摇骰子，摇出什么意外都要这帮可怜人接着。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 620}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "时间自然酝酿一切伟大的情节，对于平淡的时段按下快进键就行了。", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 651}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "别盘算着把我直接放进去。", "char_start": 652, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "把我直接放进去什么结局都是大团圆，最没意思了。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 688}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何写出像权力的游戏这样的小说？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“权力的游戏”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“第一是大量阅读目标时期的文学和历史作品，大量浏览同一时代的实物展览、建筑古迹。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "第一是大量阅读目标时期的文学和历史作品，大量浏览同一时代的实物展览、建筑古迹。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 39, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "566e2030-b43c-5ff6-ab29-00648a6f0203", "source_ordinal": 2686, "reading_ordinal": 1367, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "刑罚之外", "published_at": "2022-07-09T21:49:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/542366857/answer/2566653056"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这问题问得很不好，因为解决这类问题的根本不在于“要用刑”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "刑法并不能真的在冲动关头拦阻行为人，它只是一种为了维持社会秩序的迫于无奈不得不行的必要。只能用来阻止已成事实的失败进一步的造成更多恶果，难以阻止这失败本身的发育和成熟。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "别的不说，刺杀首相、总统显然是重大罪行，也没拦住有人刺杀首相。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "真正危险的东西，并不是社会司法威慑的“软弱”，“漏洞”，而是人的绝望和病变。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "人类要与人类的绝望本身为敌，而不是去与已经绝望的人为敌。只专注在如何去除已经绝望的人，但却对制造和帮助绝望毫不在意，这样的“解决方案”其实是没有多大意义的。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 264}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "与绝望本身为敌，意味着人对待人的方式本身需要系统的改进。", "char_start": 265, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "是最基本的每个人对待自己身边每个人的方式本身需要反思，这不是一句大口号、一个空洞的“革命召唤”，而是关系到你自己的家庭、恋人、朋友、同事、同志、邻里之间的气氛，关系到你自己每时每刻的安宁和幸福的最现实的问题。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这细微具体到你的子女没考好试你要怎么办、你的上司没有如愿让你升职你要怎么办、你的下属没有拿出最好的表现你要怎么办。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你看到这些骇人听闻的惨烈案件，该做的是去思考和探讨上面这些问题，而不是“这次要不要凌迟处死”。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 504}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为如果人已经在社会关系里绝望了，凌迟处死对ta其实是无所谓的。", "char_start": 505, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "很多只是在发泄自己的恐惧的言论，本身就在催化下一批绝望的人。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "利乐有情，待人以仁，从自己身边做起。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 587}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "很多人听到这里会感到不耐烦——“我已经做了我该做的那一份了，凭什么要我承担更多？”", "char_start": 588, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是一个错误的看法。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 640}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为这要求的不是要你做“更多”，而是要你做得更合理、更有效率。", "char_start": 641, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果你以前也是花十分钟，你看到这种人间惨剧，需要做的并不是把十分钟改成十一分钟，而是让这十分钟提高质量、提高效率。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 730}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果说有什么具体的投入，可能是你需要额外投入更大的热情和决心去思考如何让以后的每一份十分钟取得更高的成果。", "char_start": 731, "char_end": 784}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所谓成果，是指让其他人变得强健和有希望、获得安慰和休息，使人彼此间和睦和宽容。", "char_start": 785, "char_end": 824}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而你投入思考的这些时间，也大可以从你每天的十分钟里面出。", "char_start": 825, "char_end": 853}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "看到没有？没有增加你的负担。", "char_start": 854, "char_end": 868}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不但如此，这些思考的价值还远远超过这个范围。", "char_start": 869, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "拥有这种能力的人，自然而然的容易让人愿意聚拢到ta身边，仿佛溺水的人要向船舷挣扎游去。", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 935}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这对改善你自己的社会地位和事业前景也有极大的好处。", "char_start": 936, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "远远的要比关注“这次要判什么刑”有效得多。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 983}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "哪怕这些努力没有能阻止某处再次发生这事，它也能至少让你自己身边的生活环境变好，变得有生机。", "char_start": 984, "char_end": 1029}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "能促使你在这方面采取行动，当事人也就没有白白的受这个罪，这其实已经是一种很大的救赎。", "char_start": 1030, "char_end": 1072}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如何看待南昌红谷滩实习女律师当街遇害一案？\n如何评价电影《祈祷落幕时》？", "char_start": 1073, "char_end": 1109}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 1073, "sample": "如何看待南昌红谷滩实习女律师当街遇害一案？\n如何评价电影《祈祷落幕时》？"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0215"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：上海瑞金医院内一男子持刀伤人致 4 伤，警方通报「民警开枪将其击伤制服」，涉事男子将承担哪些法律责任？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“刑罚之外”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这问题问得很不好，因为解决这类问题的根本不在于“要用刑”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这问题问得很不好，因为解决这类问题的根本不在于“要用刑”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
